{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition evnt=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-unknown-attribute-typo.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-unknown-attribute-typo.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":4,"byteOffset":107,"endColumn":21,"endLine":3,"startColumn":17,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"event"}}]}],"description":{"text":"`<transition>` has an attribute with a similar name: `event`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-unknown-attribute-typo.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":21,"endLine":3,"startColumn":17,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"attribute `evnt` is not allowed on `<transition>`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.3.2.2`: Attribute 'evnt' is not allowed for this element\n\n**Help:** did you mean `event`?\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.3.2.2`)","text":"attribute `evnt` is not allowed on `<transition>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":111,"start":107},"category":"schema"},"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML elements accept only their declared attributes; extension attributes must be namespace-qualified"},"help":